S ¬ Extranjeros, Claudio X, Salinas Pliego: Presidencia exhibe a Generación Z","target":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/w4FT0mBTcbA/hqdefault.jpg","line":22,"embedded":true},{"title":"#CloseUp ¬ Después de Charlie Kirk, llega Nick Fuentes. Ultraderecha. Adora a Hitler","target":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Tm9u3gcao-E/hqdefault.jpg","line":44,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"La derecha mexicana Discord como los supremacistas en EU","source":"https://www.sinembargo.mx/4726755/la-derecha-mexicana-se-mueve-en-discord-como-los-supremacistas-y-neonazis-en-eu/","author":["[[Nora Gaspar Reséndiz]]"],"published":"2025-11-14","created":"2026-10-21","description":"La derecha mexicana se mueve en la plataforma Discord como lo hacen los los supremacistas y los neonazis en Estados Unidos, de acuerdo con diversos reportes.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Clippings/La derecha mexicana Discord como los supremacistas en EU.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"klnt3m","at":1792598180964},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.08897544,-0.05149202,0.03898405,0.01706958,0.04630008,0.00293846,-0.05620829,0.05101956,0.01670319,0.03275044,-0.02761159,-0.05475578,0.00894594,0.03635471,0.03202606,-0.03148846,0.00358071,0.03436482,-0.00350675,0.0032066,0.09851561,-0.00797764,0.05454977,-0.0263306,0.03185251,-0.00465354,-0.05544385,-0.02554896,-0.10801468,-0.20151818,0.02672557,0.00980051,0.06470727,-0.06623216,-0.02730485,-0.04783952,0.03535924,-0.03251335,-0.00578592,0.03463396,0.01458502,0.0197333,-0.05897637,-0.03632866,0.00883326,-0.08785108,-0.00069263,-0.01382373,-0.03688481,-0.02718507,-0.02261639,0.02966223,0.03117619,-0.02695717,0.01561306,0.0427638,0.00578173,-0.0068074,0.0379,0.03060541,0.0388686,0.04772136,-0.22121155,0.07591459,0.00184724,0.03264658,0.00478711,0.02998808,0.00247166,-0.02616704,0.0141013,0.02149883,0.02941975,0.05712928,0.02908364,0.03872738,0.05081188,-0.0382672,-0.06355368,-0.015942